{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/Steam_Desc_Banner_Title_02.gif?t=1752926757\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BLOOD RUSH</strong> is an intense roguelite FPS in development inspired by genre titans such as <i>ULTRAKILL</i> and <i>Hades</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a procedurally generated Hell, seize unique weapons, unlock new abilities, and create powerful synergies to overcome the challenges standing between you and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/Desc_Fight_01.gif?t=1752926757\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Speed and Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hell is unforgiving, your movement skills will be your greatest asset against the relentless hordes of enemies. Whether you choose to dodge attacks from a safe distance or adopt a more aggressive approach, a well-placed headshot will always make the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/Desc_Powers_01.gif?t=1752926757\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Idols and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the depths of Hell and harness the power of <strong>Relics</strong> and <strong>Idols</strong>, granting you powerful upgrades and unique abilities. Adapt your playstyle on the go based on the synergies you discover and the opportunities you seize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/Desc_Weapon_01.gif?t=1752926757\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Style and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a state of <i>flow</i> during combat to restore your health and gain various bonuses. This state is achieved by actively engaging with the game\u2019s combat mechanics and playing dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Die... and Try Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will inevitably fall\u2026 but this is not the end, <strong>you are already dead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Persevere, learn from each failure, and push ever forward in your quest for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Defeat Argos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/edafa21558ce28618dac95c8a454d6abfa5d4a90.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the censer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/0e1021d5fc5b65efb835e9fa301fbaf70a53cf46.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Antichrist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/27a5105aa18278e177551c3d5954f7935f5d04b9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Cain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/94b2a2783f5550a6e9d200de53e20005e89b7857.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Mammon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/7a79105daf8f9c6882a442fb4e8d789dd8e4c790.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Pandora's box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/6d4f21d55ec6553c07c6e6f41b61183e18b5ea85.jpg"},{"name":"Infused weapon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/8611fcf6c78b21d7c117b1bb1039a41e82481012.jpg"},{"name":"Self hatred","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435870/6fd261e9b4492367