ph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a procedurally generated Hell, seize unique weapons, unlock new abilities, and create powerful synergies to overcome the challenges standing between you and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/Desc_Fight_01.gif?t=1752926757\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Speed and Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hell is unforgiving, your movement skills will be your greatest asset against the relentless hordes of enemies. Whether you choose to dodge attacks from a safe distance or adopt a more aggressive approach, a well-placed headshot will always make the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/Desc_Powers_01.gif?t=1752926757\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Idols and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the depths of Hell and harness the power of <strong>Relics</strong> and <strong>Idols</strong>, granting you powerful upgrades and unique abilities. Adapt your playstyle on the go based on the synergies you discover and the opportunities you seize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/Desc_Weapon_01.gif?t=1752926757\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Style and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a state of <i>flow</i> during combat to restore your health and gain various bonuses. This state is achieved by actively engaging with the game\u2019s combat mechanics and playing dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Die... and Try Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will inevitably fall\u2026 but this is not the end, <strong>you are already dead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Persevere, learn from each failure, and push ever forward in your quest for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["MaxEstLa"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/header.jpg?t=1752926757","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257096526,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096526/movie480.mp4?t=1739917402","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096526/movie_max.mp4?t=1739917402"},"name":"Blood Rush - Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096526/c995c94fb84efae57776818c9c414137cf692040/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739917402","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096526/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739917402","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096526/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739917402"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256981862,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256981862/movie480.mp4?t=1711796717","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256981862/movie_max.mp4?t=1711796717"},"name":"Blood Rush - Demo Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256981862/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1711796717","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256981862/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1711796717","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256981862/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1711796717"}}],"name":"Blood Rush","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurrin